> What exactly is needed to be authorized to wish for this object ?

To be eligable to wish for an intelligent artifact (all Quest artifacts
plus Excalibur and Stormbringer), you must be of the same alignment.
Then you have a chance of getting it. If you are not of the correct
class, though, it will blast you when you pick it up or wield it (this
only applies to Quest artifacts).

You cannot wish for your own Quest artifact. This is why your Samurai
did not get the Tsurugi.

